  "details": "Note that the indicator won't change, but the animation state will.\n\nReplication:\n\nActivate a gesture on either hand and keep it active while locking gestures, then lock gestures, let go. Gesture should stay active, the parameters should not revert to 0. Now activate a direct gesture on the hand that triggered a gesture. Gesture parameter will be set to the corresponding direct gesture.\n\nThis is goofy, and should not happen. Gesture lock should prevent parameter changes through gestures.",
